        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2000 World Rally Championship\n- Organizations: FIA World Rally Championship\n- People: Carlos Sainz, Harri Rovanperä\n- Companies: SEAT, Peugeot, Mitsubishi, Red Bull Škoda Team\n\nFacts:\n- The 2000 World Rally Championship was the 28th season of the FIA World Rally Championship.\n- Carlos Sainz Cenamor was born on 12 April 1962 in Madrid, Spain.\n- Carlos Sainz Cenamor is a Spanish rally driver.\n- Harri Rovanperä drove for SEAT from 1997 to 2000.\n- Harri Rovanperä drove for Peugeot from 2001 to 2004.\n- Harri Rovanperä drove for Mitsubishi in 2005.\n- Harri Rovanperä drove for Red Bull Škoda Team in 2006.",
